WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.270
- I'm here with sports broadcast
all-star, Erin Andrews!

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.318
Give it up!

00:00:04.318 --> 00:00:05.620
(audience cheering)

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.170
I stole that from a girl
you're about to meet.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:12.695
All right, it's time to play
The Balls of Sports game.

00:00:12.695 --> 00:00:15.735
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.735 --> 00:00:18.060
First, we need a host. Voice of God,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.720
do you have a few minutes please?

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.730
- [God] For Kelly
Clarkson and Sports Ball?

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:25.510
Of course. And hello, Erin Andrews.

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:27.080
- Hi. It's like the Wizard of Oz.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.290
- [Kelly] Yes, yes.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:29.623
God, He loves our show.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.170
So God, can you explain the game?

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.550
- [God] Well, there's very
little I can't do, Kelly.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:36.383
- Okay.

00:00:36.383 --> 00:00:37.920
- [God] You see, in this game, you win

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.180
by getting three squares
in a row on that big board

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.890
you see there, like tic-tac-toe.

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:43.723
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:43.723 --> 00:00:46.240
- [God] Now to win a square,
you throw a sports ball

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.800
through the matching sports square.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.460
Then, you'll get a
question about that sport.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.640
Now, if you get it right,
you win the square.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.970
But if you get it wrong,

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:57.264
the other person wins the square because,

00:00:57.264 --> 00:00:59.872
well, that's how life
works sometimes, don't it.

00:00:59.872 --> 00:01:00.900
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.820
- [God] Now you and Erin
will alternate turns, okay?

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:07.040
Now Kelly, since you paid
me off before the show,

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.520
why don't you go first?

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.390
- Okay, I had to take my shoes
off, because that's real.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:12.869
- [Erin] Sorry, Micah, I'm doing it too.

00:01:12.869 --> 00:01:13.702
(crosstalk)

00:01:13.702 --> 00:01:14.630
- [God] Please remove your shoes.

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:15.592
- [Erin] Done.

00:01:15.592 --> 00:01:16.750
- [Kelly] Okay, okay, shoes are done.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.860
I'm about to get destroyed, God,

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:21.150
and you know this because I
know nothing about sports balls,

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:22.980
so can I call in some help please?

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:24.580
- [God] Hey, it's my
world, but it's your show.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:25.820
You do you, girl.

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:26.950
- All right, all right!

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:29.440
Well, let's call it my Sports Ball Posse.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.950
This is my real posse
who loves Sports Ball,

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:36.575
my sister Alisa, and my
friends, Tricia, Alli and Ava.

00:01:36.575 --> 00:01:37.712
Whoo!

00:01:37.712 --> 00:01:39.487
(audience cheering)

00:01:39.487 --> 00:01:40.420
- You get a team?

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.850
- Yes, I do, and y'all
can thank the lovely Ava

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:46.540
for my always and annoying--
(Kelly makes honking noise)

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.569
because she does it all the time.

00:01:48.569 --> 00:01:49.402
All right, so--

00:01:49.402 --> 00:01:50.900
- [God] All right, let's
calm down now, Kelly.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.132
- I'm excited God!

00:01:52.132 --> 00:01:54.130
- [God] I understand.
Let's rein it in here

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.660
and pick your square.

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:58.170
- Okay, pick my square.
What should I pick, y'all?

00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.534
What do you think I should pick?

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:00.367
- [Sports Ball Posse together] Football.

00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:01.358
- Football.

00:02:01.358 --> 00:02:02.191
- Come on!

00:02:02.191 --> 00:02:03.030
- [Kelly] That was like,
obviously! They were like, okay.

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:05.580
I'm running up here, I
can't do anything like that.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:06.706
There we go, okay.
- [God] There it is.

00:02:06.706 --> 00:02:07.539
- Okay.

00:02:07.539 --> 00:02:09.010
- [God] Okay, and here is your question.

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:09.843
- Okay.

00:02:09.843 --> 00:02:14.300
- [God] What NFL team has only
a single Super Bowl victory

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:18.473
which they won in 2018 at Super Bowl 52?

00:02:18.473 --> 00:02:19.780
(buzzer dings)

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:20.710
- [Kelly] Posse?

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:21.608
- It was the Eagles!

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:23.045
- The Eagles, final answer.

00:02:23.045 --> 00:02:23.999
- Eagles! Final answer!

00:02:23.999 --> 00:02:25.632
- [God] All right, press
that buzzer, lock it in.

00:02:25.632 --> 00:02:26.624
- Eagles, final answer!

00:02:26.624 --> 00:02:27.630
(bell dings)
- That is correct.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:28.926
It is the Eagles.

00:02:28.926 --> 00:02:32.440
- Okay! I literally was
there and I don't remember.

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.152
- [God] Erin, it's your turn.

00:02:34.152 --> 00:02:35.290
- Oh, God!

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:38.010
- Okay, I'm picking. All right. Oh man.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.421
- [God] Come on, now, time's running out.

00:02:39.421 --> 00:02:40.960
- All right, all right, all
right. I'll do basketball.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.383
- [God] That's it. There
you go, come on, get it.

00:02:42.383 --> 00:02:44.591
- What a cute little pencil skirt number.

00:02:44.591 --> 00:02:45.424
(Erin cheers)

00:02:45.424 --> 00:02:46.988
- [God] Okay, that's all right.

00:02:46.988 --> 00:02:48.946
(Kelly laughs)
(audience cheers)

00:02:48.946 --> 00:02:52.680
- [God] The question is, what
is the name of the Duke Men's

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.418
basketball coach?

00:02:54.418 --> 00:02:56.280
(buzzer dings)

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:59.443
- Mike Krzyzewski, coach K, yes.

00:02:59.443 --> 00:03:00.350
- Oh, I was like--
(bell dings)

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:01.790
- [God] That is correct.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.920
- My next question, you spell it.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:04.753
No, you don't have to.

00:03:04.753 --> 00:03:07.148
- No, I was going to say, "K." (laughs)

00:03:07.148 --> 00:03:08.373
- [God] All right, Kelly.

00:03:08.373 --> 00:03:10.123
- I'm doing baseball!

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:13.758
(Posse cheers indistinctly)

00:03:13.758 --> 00:03:15.320
- [God] There it is.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.592
All right, here's your question.

00:03:16.592 --> 00:03:19.940
In what year did the Atlanta Braves

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:22.220
most recently win the World Series?

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.053
- Oh my God.

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:26.506
- These are the hardest questions.

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:27.818
(all shouting)

00:03:27.818 --> 00:03:29.928
- You love baseball!

00:03:29.928 --> 00:03:32.178
- It was in the 90s, right?

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:33.460
- '94, '96.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.120
- It wasn't 94.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.726
- How do you know?

00:03:36.726 --> 00:03:37.782
- 96!
(bell dings)

00:03:37.782 --> 00:03:38.899
(incorrect buzzer sounds)

00:03:38.899 --> 00:03:41.010
- [God] I'm sorry, that is incorrect.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.884
The answer was 1995.
(bell dings)

00:03:42.884 --> 00:03:45.065
- Ah, I was going to say '95!

00:03:45.065 --> 00:03:47.897
(all shouting)
- So close.

00:03:47.897 --> 00:03:49.890
All right, Erin, go ahead
now, it's your turn.

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:51.180
You get to--

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.720
- Well, I would have to say volleyball,

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:53.690
but I'm going to get it wrong,

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.610
because I don't know
anything about volleyball.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:58.893
- Well then I think you should
pick volleyball. (laughs)

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.210
- [God] Boom. There you go, all right.

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.770
And here is your question.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:04.650
- Oh God.

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:08.840
- What tasty buttermilk
breakfast entree usually served

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:12.300
with maple syrup is also a volleyball move

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:14.990
where a player falls to
the floor in an attempt

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:16.739
to save the ball?

00:04:16.739 --> 00:04:19.258
(buzzer dings)
- Pancake?

00:04:19.258 --> 00:04:20.680
(bell dings)
- That is correct!

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.290
- [Kelly] I knew that one!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:23.550
I actually knew that one,

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:24.800
I thought it was gonna be a person.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.974
- I think I win!
(congratulatory music)

00:04:26.974 --> 00:04:29.854
- [God] You do!
(all cheering)

00:04:29.854 --> 00:04:32.569
Look at that, unbelievable.
How does it feel, Kelly?

00:04:32.569 --> 00:04:34.338
- Let me tell you how I feel.

00:04:34.338 --> 00:04:39.338
Loser! Loser! Loser! Loser! (laughs)

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:43.840
Okay, good game, we're all
good sports ball people here,

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.430
sports team-- what is it?

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:48.910
Sportsmanship, sportsmanship,
all the sports words.

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:52.250
As a reward, your portrait
will be mounted alongside

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.658
very few others on the Blake
Shelton Wall of Champions

00:04:55.658 --> 00:04:57.560
for beating Kelly Clarkson, that's hot.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.460
You're welcome.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:04:59.578
- Super hot.

00:04:59.578 --> 00:05:01.930
- Thank you so much for playing again.

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:05.550
So everyone out there can watch
on all your favorite devices

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:10.220
like Roku, Amazon, Fire TV,
iPhone, and many others.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.310
And be sure to check out
Erin clothing line, WEAR,

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.623
which we should have all
been wearing today, what?

